{
  "id": "chromatic-folds",
  "name": "Chromatic Folds",
  "url": "shaders/chromatic-folds.wgsl",
  "description": "Geometric colour folding: hues fold around a pivot, displaced along the hue gradient. The two faces of the fold are lit and shaded, the pivot line stress-whitens like a paper crease, a reverse-sheet tap shows the back of the fold at hue edges, and history feeds back. Click ripples add pressure waves.",
